# Compiled blueprint tool binaries. `go build ./...` inside a tool dir drops the
# binary next to main.go, so the name matches the directory. Add a line per tool
# that ships one — do not broad-match `tools/*/*`, it also swallows READMEs and
# any subdirectory a tool grows.
blueprints/code-memory-blueprint/tools/branch-verify/branch-verify
